## Required Fixes

### Fix 1: Add `pipeliner-cli` to workspace (CRITICAL)
```toml
# In Cargo.toml
[workspace]
members = [
    ...
    "crates/pipeliner-cli",  # Add this
]
```

### Fix 2: Wire `--parallelism` to executor (CRITICAL)
```rust
// In run_pipeline_once(), after building executor:
if let Some(parallelism) = args.parallelism {
    executor = executor.with_max_parallelism(parallelism);
}
```

### Fix 3: Wire per-stage `fail_fast` (CRITICAL)
```rust
// In execute_stage() loop, change:
if !stage_result.success {
    pipeline_success = false;
    let fail_fast = stage_spec.options.as_ref()
        .map(|o| o.fail_fast)
        .unwrap_or(self.config.fail_fast);
    if fail_fast {
        break;
    }
}
```
